# Event coverage for previously untested engine paths
name: event-coverage
version: 1
description: Covers rtc_invalid, set_ms, read_absent, expect_read and the storage availability gate.

boot
rtc_invalid
read CHIP-001
assert last_result RECORDED
assert observation 0 clock_status UNKNOWN
assert observation 0 epoch_ms null
set_ms 5000
read CHIP-002
assert observation 1 monotonic_ms 5000
read_absent
assert observations 2
expect_read CHIP-003 RECORDED
assert observations 3
assert last_result RECORDED
storage_unavailable
reboot
assert not_ready
assert observations 3
storage_available
reboot
assert ready
assert observations 3
assert node_id unchanged
